00:51:38.490 --> 00:51:41.829
Glenn Gore (Affinidi Pte Ltd): security profiles that we think of for the VTA.

337
00:51:41.990 --> 00:51:52.230
Glenn Gore (Affinidi Pte Ltd): From least secure to most secure. Least secure is it's a development environment, and all your secrets are in clear text in config files, just used for, you know, mock testing.

338
00:51:52.570 --> 00:52:01.020
Glenn Gore (Affinidi Pte Ltd): Second security model is actually what would be here, which is it's hosted, the secrets are protected, but…

339
00:52:01.200 --> 00:52:11.839
