340
00:52:11.840 --> 00:52:25.160
Glenn Gore (Affinidi Pte Ltd): the VTA. The third security model is where you need to move towards trusted execution environments, the TEEs. I will say that when you shift to TEEs, the cost goes up

341
00:52:25.360 --> 00:52:45.130
Glenn Gore (Affinidi Pte Ltd): massively. You can only run about 4 partitions on a TEE, and their cost starts at kind of hundreds of dollars per month, divided by 4. In that third model, there's a hardened hardware security, manager, HSM,

342
00:52:46.100 --> 00:52:47.730
Glenn Gore (Affinidi Pte Ltd): it still…

343
00:52:48.120 --> 00:53:07.329
