344
00:53:07.360 --> 00:53:10.509
Glenn Gore (Affinidi Pte Ltd): will be part of the next release of VTA.

345
00:53:10.590 --> 00:53:18.760
Glenn Gore (Affinidi Pte Ltd): where there is a onion model of a TEE, within a TEE.

346
00:53:18.950 --> 00:53:26.410
Glenn Gore (Affinidi Pte Ltd): And nobody can unlock it, so you… the admin of the hosting admin can unlock the outer VTA,

347
00:53:26.510 --> 00:53:41.569
